      "value": "@{627e94e69bf04e1ede28a21b|full_name}: Easy way to reproduce;  \nGo to the Suburban Lakehouse world \nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_0c2cbf7d-bfd9-4dc7-9ba7-97e4fd0a9489\nHang around there with around 10+ people, get some avatars firing off audio effects to hasten it.  Within about an hour (if not half that) the audio will break, guaranteed.  And it'll tank the audio engine on EVERYONE in the instance over a span of minutes when it does.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
